node_modules/
*.log

# Deployment-local: the session secret, the internal-API token and the
# database URL all end up here, and none of them belong in the tree.
.env

# Built front end.
/public/

# The picture and the typeface the site reads from web/public/, deliberately in
# no repository.
#
# What they are is the operator's business and this file makes no claim about
# it — which is the point. A repository that names an origin it cannot verify
# has written down a guess, and a wrong guess about provenance is worse than
# none. Whatever is put here, it is put by the person running the site and it
# stays on their machine.
#
# A clone without them renders on the plain dark ground with a serif fallback —
# a duller site, not a broken one.
#
# See README, "The picture and the face".
/web/public/

# Editor and agent scratch: local paths, not the application.
.claude/
